{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9kfqh8na","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":64,"top":210,"width":1140,"height":370},"text":"Edge capacity 4/4 to 12/12: Edge placements rise from 2 to 8.\nMean response rises to 70.56 ms because Edge processes slower.\nEdge delay 5 to 90 ms: mean 76.39 ms, same placement counts.\nFixed latency, reserved CPU and synthetic work are assumptions.\nDemo identities illustrate authorization, not authentication.\nReproduce with the experiment runner and unittest suite.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#163343","alignment":"left"}}
